Hardware video MFTs can issue NeedInput ahead of HaveOutput for the same
submission. Preserve pending input requests while waiting for low-delay output:
a static browser page may never submit a second frame. Bound the wait for MFTs
that require another input. Other modes retain their existing event handling.

